# [[hi]]

====Usage notes====

The use of {{term|hæ|lang=is}} and {{term|bæ|lang=is}} (corresponding to English {{term|hi|lang=en}} and {{term|bye|lang=en}}, respectively) is often frowned upon, especially among older people. {{term|sæll|lang=is}}/{{term|sæl|lang=is}} and {{term|bless|lang=is}} should be used instead.

